WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.540
This is AI Academy, the customs and trade training platform from Tradevics AI.

2
00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:11.360
It's built for importers, C&F agents and tax practitioners in Bangladesh.

3
00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:20.960
Choose from courses on HS classification, customs valuation, ASYCUDA, VAT, rules of origin and letters of credit.

4
00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:27.350
Every lesson comes with AI lecture notes, a full transcript and the legal texts you'll cite.

5
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:33.550
In the practical lab, the Simulator Agent plays the assessing officer on a real consignment.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.660
You answer, and the Evaluation Engine scores you against the examiner's rubric, with feedback on every point.

7
00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:48.300
Sit timed exams, mock papers and case studies. The Examiner Agent sets fresh questions on every attempt.

8
00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:53.920
Your dashboard shows where you're strong, where you're behind, and what to study next.

9
00:00:54.370 --> 00:01:01.080
When the rules change, experts teach live. Transcripts, notes and slides are produced automatically.

10
00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:04.830
Ask questions in discussion groups for your profession.

11
00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:10.350
Your mentor reviews your progress, writes a monthly report and meets you one-to-one.

12
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:15.470
Pass, and you earn a certificate that any employer can verify online.

13
00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:21.860
Admins manage courses, exams, live classes and the AI agents from one portal.

14
00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:25.130
And everything works in English and Bangla.

15
00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:31.570
AI Academy. Rehearse the assessment before the officer asks. Start learning today.
